---
import ContentLayout from '../layouts/ContentLayout.astro';
---

<ContentLayout
  title="Software Support | Fluxology, Inc."
  description="Support and contact information for software products developed and published by Fluxology, Inc."
  eyebrow="Software support"
  heading="Support for Fluxology software"
  intro="Fluxology, Inc. provides support for the applications and digital tools it develops and publishes."
>
  <section>
    <h2>Contact support</h2>
    <p>
      For an app issue, bug report, general feedback, feature request or privacy question, contact Fluxology using
      the support address below. Please include the product name, device or browser, operating-system version where
      relevant, and a concise description of what happened.
    </p>
    <div class="content-callout">
      <strong>Fluxology, Inc.</strong><br />
      Ontario, Canada<br />
      <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:info@fluxology.ca">info@fluxology.ca</a><br />
      <strong>Web contact:</strong> <a href="/#contact">fluxology.ca/#contact</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Products in development</h2>
    <div class="content-card-grid">
      <article class="content-card">
        <h3>Office Scout</h3>
        <p class="content-meta">Pre-release / active development</p>
        <p>
          For questions or feedback about Office Scout, use the support contact above and identify “Office Scout”
          in the subject or message. Product-specific help and release information will be published here before
          public distribution.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="content-card">
        <h3>Fluxology Deals</h3>
        <p class="content-meta">Pre-release / active development</p>
        <p>
          For questions or feedback about Fluxology Deals, use the support contact above and identify “Fluxology
          Deals” in the subject or message. Product-specific help and release information will be published here
          before public distribution.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>What Fluxology supports</h2>
    <p>
      Fluxology supports its own published products. It does not advertise or provide contract iOS or app-development
      services for third parties. General company and future operating-line inquiries can still be sent through the
      main contact form.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      Privacy questions and requests can be sent to the same support address. The current corporate privacy policy
      is available at <a href="/privacy/">fluxology.ca/privacy/</a>. Product-specific disclosures will be published
      as required when an application is released.
    </p>
  </section>
</ContentLayout>
